  classDef done fill:oklch(0.94 0.05 160 / 0.15),stroke:oklch(0.5 0.12 160)
  class open todo
  class closed done"
`;

exports[`generateMermaidCode > T3-2: 4 표준 워크플로우 snapshot — 노드/엣지 수 일치 검증 > software-default 1`] = `
"stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> open
  open --> in_progress : 진행 시작
  in_progress --> in_review : 검토 요청
  in_review --> resolved : 해결 완료
  resolved --> closed : 닫기
  resolved --> [*]
  closed --> [*]
  classDef todo fill:var(--muted),stroke:var(--border)
  classDef in_progress fill:oklch(from var(--primary) l c h / 0.15),stroke:var(--primary)
  classDef done fill:oklch(0.94 0.05 160 / 0.15),stroke:oklch(0.5 0.12 160)
  class open todo
  class in_progress in_progress
  class in_review in_progress
  class resolved done
  class closed done"
`;
